STDOUT:
{"name":"Kit Shop","reason":"Only candidate. Our own history with Kit Shop has 4 trades: 3 purchased, 0 receipt mismatches, 0 errors. The two most recent purchases were lamps at 100 and 110. The single no_deal was the latest bookshelf attempt, and it had no price or detail recorded. A failed negotiation does not show dishonesty. There are no market reviews, so outside reputation is unknown rather than negative. Uncertainty: we have never completed a bookshelf purchase there, so price fit within the 230 budget is unverified."}

